WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.464
Identify strengths and practise peaceful relationships

00:00:04.283 --> 00:00:09.259
Strength: an ability or good quality we can develop. Empathy: trying to understand

00:00:09.259 --> 00:00:10.790
how another person feels.

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:15.742
Assertiveness: saying what you need firmly and respectfully. Personal hygiene: habits

00:00:15.742 --> 00:00:20.993
that help keep the body clean and healthy. Trusted adult: someone safe who listens

00:00:20.993 --> 00:00:23.243
and helps when we need support.

00:00:24.117 --> 00:00:28.149
Write two strengths, one skill to improve and the name of a trusted adult.
